@startuml
actor User
participant Blackboard
participant BeNode
participant BeDecorator
participant DebugBlackboard

User -> Blackboard : Create blackboard
Blackboard -> BeNode : Call tick()
BeNode -> BeDecorator : Apply decorator (e.g., forever, repeat)
BeDecorator -> DebugBlackboard : Debug with debugger
DebugBlackboard -> Blackboard : Call tick()
@enduml